Join our high-impact AI team within BNP Paribas’s Corporate & Institutional Banking (CIB) division, where we develop and scale a cutting-edge software platform powering the entire corporate credit chain - from origination to monitoring. Used by thousands of employees across 50+ countries since 2019, our platform is a critical backbone for global credit operations.
Requirements:
- Bachelor degree from an engineering school or equivalent university with an IT specialization;
- Knowledge of Java 17+, JUnit, Mockito;
- Excellent command of source‑code collaboration tools, particularly Git;
- Basic knowledge about Continous Integration, HTTP network protocol, messaging systems and design patterns;
- Nice to have: Spring/Quarkus framework, ORM framework (like Hibernate), TypeScript, HTML, Angular 21;
- Fluent English;
- Curiosity and willingness to learn and adapt quickly;
- Passionate about new technologies;
- Willingness and ability to work with local and remote multicultural teams;
